OL,3,ARussell Brand to be sentenced for rape
OL,4,Aand sexual assault
OL,5,
OL,6,FRussell Brand will be sentenced today
OL,7,Ffor rape and three counts of sexual
OL,8,Fassault
OL,10,FBrand, 51, was found guilty at
OL,11,FSouthwark Crown Court on Thursday,
OL,12,Fafter a trial that began in October
OL,14,FFollowing the verdicts, judge Mr
OL,15,FJustice Bennathan told Brand to expect
OL,16,F"a significant custodial term" - he was
OL,17,Fremanded in custody, meaning he has
OL,18,Fspent the past four nights in prison
OL,19,Fbefore sentencing
OL,23,APub: 09-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBCultureC Nat RadioFTechnology
